 "notes": "Identities without positions in the deck and the face-down extra deck (obs:unpositioned_). Player 0 (Sky Striker; one Upstart Goblin replaced by Lemnisgate and the two other Engage by Upstart Goblin, so the deck's only Engage is the one shuffled back) activates Engage and adds Area Zero (confirmed, then the hand is shuffled), Normal Summons Raye, Link Summons Kagari with it (declining Kagari's trigger) and Hayate with Kagari, then activates Sky Striker Special Maneuver - Lemnisgate! targeting Kagari and Engage in the graveyard: Engage is shuffled into the main deck, Kagari returns face-down to the extra deck. At player 1's turn-2 main phase player 1 knows one Engage in player 0's deck, one Kagari among the face-down extra deck and one Area Zero in the hand, none at a place. The variant is another hidden truth behind the same public stream: Upstart Goblin instead of Ash Blossom in player 0's hand, its undrawn deck reversed."
